+Planning 진입 시 Tool Route는 이미 확정되어 있다. `ToolArgumentCandidateV1`은 계속 business arguments only이며 workflow status/confirmation metadata를 추가하지 않는다.
+
+ACTION 준비용 local-only discriminated contract:
+
+```python
+class PlanningActionReadyV1:
+    disposition: Literal["READY"]
+    route_id: str
+    bound_tool_schema: BoundSelectedToolSchemaV1
+
+class PlanningActionNeedsConfirmationV1:
+    disposition: Literal["NEEDS_CONFIRMATION"]
+    route_id: str
+    question: str
+    options: list[str]
+    reason_codes: list[str]
+
+class PlanningActionRouteReconsiderationV1:
+    disposition: Literal["ROUTE_RECONSIDERATION_REQUIRED"]
+    route_id: str
+    reason_codes: list[str]
+
+class PlanningActionBlockedV1:
+    disposition: Literal["BLOCKED"]
+    route_id: str
+    reason_codes: list[str]
+
+PlanningActionPreparationResultV1 = (
+    PlanningActionReadyV1
+    | PlanningActionNeedsConfirmationV1
+    | PlanningActionRouteReconsiderationV1
+    | PlanningActionBlockedV1
+)
+```
+
+`DefaultContainerResolver`를 포함한 deterministic preparation이 required container를 resolve하지 못하면 해당 route는 `NEEDS_CONFIRMATION`을 반환하고 **Argument Writer를 호출하지 않는다**. `READY`인 route만 per-route Argument Writer에 전달한다. `NEEDS_CONFIRMATION`은 Application이 `ConfirmationRequiredV1`으로 projection하고 same Planning checkpoint resume을 사용한다. Resume metadata는 LLM/Argument Writer가 만들지 않는다.
 
